        <description>Package updates are available for Alibaba Cloud Linux 4 that fix the following vulnerabilities:

CVE-2025-32464:
HAProxy 2.2 through 3.1.6, in certain uncommon configurations, has a sample_conv_regsub heap-based buffer overflow because of mishandling of the replacement of multiple short patterns with a longer one.</description>
