        <definition class="patch" id="oval:com.aliyun:def:20260104" version="1">
      <metadata>
        <title>ALINUX4-SA-2026:0104: kernel security update (Important)</title>
        <affected family="unix">
          <platform>Alibaba Cloud Linux 4</platform>
        </affected>
        <reference ref_id="ALINUX4-SA-2026:0104" ref_url="https://alas.aliyun-inc.com/errata/detail/ALINUX4-SA-2026:0104" source="ALINUX4-SA"/>
        <description>Package updates are available for Alibaba Cloud Linux 4 that fix the following vulnerabilities:

CVE-2026-31431:
In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:
crypto: algif_aead - Revert to operating out-of-place
This mostly reverts commit 72548b093ee3 except for the copying of
the associated data.
There is no benefit in operating in-place in algif_aead since the
source and destination come from different mappings.  Get rid of
all the complexity added for in-place operation and just copy the
AD directly.</description>
        <advisory from="alas.aliyun-inc.com">
